Merges the best of two independently-developed kernel-build fix sets
(Agent A session work + Agent B review patch), each audited against the
other; every fix carries a reproducer verified byte-identical to GNU as
/ GCC where applicable.

== Assembler (x86-64) ==
* R_X86_64_PC64 for 8-byte `.quad sym - .` slots (jump_table/static_call
  keys). PC32-patching an 8-byte slot leaves the upper half zero instead
  of sign-extending: corrupt address for any negative delta. PROOF:
  jl2.c reloc dump identical to GCC (PC32 code, PC32 target, PC64 key).
* .code32 regions delegate to the i686 encoder WITH reloc-type
  translation (R_386_32=1 would type-pun to R_X86_64_64=1 in an ELF64
  object: 8-byte patch overwriting the next instruction; GOTOFF=9 vs
  GOTPCREL=9 differ semantically). Unknown types are rejected loudly.
  .code16 in a 64-bit TU fails closed (use -m16).
* Section alignment starts at 1, raised only by real .align/.p2align
  directives (GNU as semantics); function entries get an explicit
  .p2align 4. Forcing 16 on every exec section shifted
  .altinstr_replacement offsets out from under .altinstructions.
* Deferred .skip resolved BEFORE jump relaxation; align markers shifted
  on skip resize (branches landed mid-instruction in sev.o otherwise;
  vc_do_mmio at 0x2043 vs GAS 0x2050).
* Instructions: lcall/lcalll/lcallq (FF /3, REX.W for m16:64),
  suffix-less tzcnt/lzcnt/popcnt, rdpid (F3 0F C7 /7, no REX.W in
  64-bit; r32 form in i686), stac/clac/clui/stui/serialize/rdpkru/
  wrpkru/monitor/mwait/wbnoinvd, segment-override prefixes as
  standalone (`ds wrmsr`), rep/lock prefix detection tab-tolerant.
* i686: pushw reg16/mem/segment forms, popw mirror, calll/retl/retw,
  lcallw with 0x66 + imm16 offset (realmode BIOS far call).
* Parser: .set register aliases substituted with word-boundary matching
  (vgetrandom-chacha.S); LHS addends in symbol diffs
  (`.word .Ljmp + 1 - sym`); spaceless `label-N-.` and `a-b+N`
  (vdso32 sigreturn.S DWARF idioms); macro params split at paren depth
  0 with :req/:vararg qualifiers stripped and `==`-safe default
  detection; semicolon-spliced macro bodies re-expanded recursively
  (FILL_RETURN_BUFFER's quoted ANNOTATE arguments).

== Codegen ==
* Inline asm bracketed with #APP/#NO_APP; the x86 peephole pins the
  region as opaque (LineKind::InlineAsm, all reg_refs set). Kernel
  ALTERNATIVE() templates use deliberate `movq %rax,%rax` as length
  placeholders — the SelfMove pass deleted one and .altinstructions
  recorded orig_len=0. PROOF: alt.c .altinstructions bytes identical
  to GCC (0303, was 0003).
* -mindirect-branch=thunk-inline: full GCC-verified retpoline expanded
  at every indirect call/jump site (vDSO cannot reference kernel
  thunks). Sequences byte-equivalent to gcc -O2 output; runtime-tested.
  Switch-table dispatch included.
* -mskip-rax-setup honored (gated on -mno-sse where it is sound):
  drops the xorl %eax,%eax before variadic calls. PROOF: kernel-flag
  build shows no %al setup, plain build keeps it.
* asm operand loads select destination width from the MNEMONIC
  (movzbl + %rdi is unencodable).
* block-label renumbering rewrites ALL instruction-carried BlockIds:
  asm-goto goto_labels, Phi incoming, LabelAddr, and
  global_init_label_blocks (stale ids made %l[..] reference deleted
  labels: reloc against null symbol, objtool 'special: can't find new
  instruction').

== Frontend ==
* __typeof_unqual__/typeof_unqual (C23) → Typeof (percpu accessors).
* __has_attribute/__has_builtin/__has_feature/__has_extension expand in
  ordinary code lines, not just #if (kernel/trace/trace.c arithmetic).
  PROOF: 0x28a0 constant identical to GCC.
* fortify-string.h builtins (strncat/memchr/strspn/strcspn/strpbrk/
  stpncpy) with correct Ptr/U64 return types.

== Driver ==
* Kernel -m flags with per-flag semantic justification: -mno-red-zone
  (lccc never uses the red zone by construction), -mno-80387/-msoft-
  float/-mno-fp-ret-in-387 (recorded as no_x87 for fail-closed FP),
  -mindirect-branch-register (vacuous: only call *%reg emitted),
  -mindirect-branch-cs-prefix (recorded), -malign-data=* (ABI alignment
  always satisfied), -mpreferred-stack-boundary/-mstack-alignment
  (<=16 accepted as superset guarantee, >16 rejected),
  -march=i386..i686 for -m16/-m32 realmode objects.
* Fail-closed rejections with config guidance: -pg/-mfentry/
  -mrecord-mcount (no ftrace instrumentation), -fstack-protector*
  (no canary emission — kbuild probes and disables STACKPROTECTOR),
  -mharden-sls (no SLS hardening).
* -mno-<isa> blanket-accept for pure disable probes ONLY (a compiler
  that cannot emit a feature already complies); LCCC_STRICT_MFLAGS=1
  restores hard errors for auditing.

== Optimizer ==
* aggregate_copy_forward: dominance walk bounds-checks the usize::MAX
  idom sentinel of unreachable blocks (kernel BUG() paths panicked the
  compiler on kernel/signal.c).
* redundant_ext self_update: operand split derived from tokenized
  mnemonic, immune to tab-separated operands (slice-inversion panic).

VALIDATION: 673/673 lib, 167/167 regression (incl. new
asm_goto_jump_table), 50/50 correctness, 3/3 intrinsics, 86/86 linker,
300/300 differential fuzz vs GCC.
